---
import { ShieldCheck, Printer, ScanFace } from "lucide-react";
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-background relative overflow-hidden z-0">
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[700px] h-[700px] bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none -z-10"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 lg:mb-20">
      <span
        class="text-primary font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-4 block"
        >Por qué elegirnos</span
      >
      <h2
        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-slate-900 mb-6 font-bold"
      >
        Diferenciales que marcan la diferencia
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
        No todas las clínicas son iguales. Combinamos décadas de experiencia con
        el más alto estándar tecnológico y avales de nivel mundial.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto"
    >
      {/* Tarjeta 1: Experiencia */}
      <div
        class="bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-3xl p-8 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 group"
      >
        <div
          class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-primary mb-4 tracking-tighter"
        >
          +22<span class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold ml-1 text-slate-400"
            >Años</span
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Trayectoria</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          De experiencia continua perfeccionando el arte y la ciencia de la
          odontología de vanguardia.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Tarjeta 2: Volumen */}
      <div
        class="bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-3xl p-8 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 group"
      >
        <div
          class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-primary mb-4 tracking-tighter"
        >
          +11K<span class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold ml-1 text-slate-400"
          ></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Pacientes Felices</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Un volumen que refleja confianza masiva y respalda nuestros resultados
          clínicos excepcionales.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Tarjeta 3: Tecnología In-House */}
      <div
        class="md:col-span-2 bg-white border border-slate-100 rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center group overflow-hidden relative transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/8 blur-3xl rounded-full opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"
        >
        </div>

        <div class="md:w-1/2 relative z-10">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Laboratorio Digital Propio
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Nuestra infraestructura "In-House" elimina intermediarios,
            garantizando la máxima celeridad y precisión biométrica en cada
            etapa de tu tratamiento.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="md:w-1/2 flex flex-row gap-4 relative z-10 w-full">
          <div
            class="bg-primary/10 border border-primary/10 p-6 rounded-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500"
          >
            <ScanFace className="w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3" />
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 block mb-1"
              >3</span
            >
            <span
              class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold"
              >Escáneres<br />3D</span
            >
            <span
              class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2 block border-t border-primary/10 pt-2 w-full"
              >(2 Intra, 1 Extra)</span
            >
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-primary/10 border border-primary/10 p-6 rounded-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 delay-75"
          >
            <Printer className="w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3" />
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 block mb-1"
              >4</span
            >
            <span
              class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold"
              >Impresoras<br />Resina</span
            >
            <span
              class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2 block border-t border-primary/10 pt-2 w-full"
              >Alta Precisión</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
